## About

Tech Innovative Club (TIC) is a student-driven technical community of the Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering, Baba Institute of Technology and Sciences, Visakhapatnam.

TIC promotes technology, innovation, projects, research, coding, hands-on learning, and collaboration among students.
